{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ys5NhWUkmH1795869389.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國公開從日本徵集到的侵華日軍化學戰新罪證，是一款向敵軍投毒的容器。</p><p></p><p>侵華日軍第731部隊罪證陳列館公布的，是這款侵華日軍「九五式」手動便攜撒毒器補給罐。看上去像滅火筒，外觀保存完好，瓶身鑄有製造時間，內部有專用的防護塗層。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EVIDENCE-2000-1_CLEAN_20261128_203305_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H9B3qMTVaE1795869348.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>侵華日軍第731部隊罪證陳列館研究人員金士成說：「首先注射了芥子氣之類的糜爛性毒劑。由化學兵身著防護服，全副武裝之後，背著它然後用噴嘴，通過噴嘴來釋毒，主要對所謂敵軍通過的道路進行釋毒。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EVIDENCE-2000-1_CLEAN_20261128_203305.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026a45cZcHTVn1795869376.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>研究人員稱，日軍在戰場上除了用毒氣彈投毒外，還會有使用特種車輛及人手撒毒。</p><p></p><p><strong>完整裝備屬實物罪證</strong></p><p></p><p>金士成說：「這個補給罐是留存下來完整的裝備，直接證明了日軍有組織、制式化，研發、裝備並使用糜爛性毒劑，是違反國際公法的實物罪證。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.EVIDENCE 2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Q8fWORbfxo1795870071.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，館方一項最新研究發現侵華日軍第516部隊，曾組建一隊約70人的隊伍，專門負責轉運、掩埋及遺棄遺留化學武器。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:58:50.699246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:45.524212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:52:14.889833+00:00","content_hash":"dc4d8be93b874c8f82be602ae6e323177143e128af3b380c29254965083145c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}